{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_A4A81DAC","title":"Ava suggests who might know more","entry":"Dlg_A4A81DAC::entry","exit":"Dlg_A4A81DAC::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_134AE4EE","articyId":"72057645577587540","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I have managed to decrypt the rest of Thaddeus's message. If you would like to hear it?","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have managed to decrypt the rest of Thaddeus's message. If you would like to hear it?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":525.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21936","byteOffset":16185720,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_B5FBD867","articyId":"72057645577587553","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"... She won't admit it if confronted. You have to trick her. The key is engaging her subsystems devoted to pleasing you. The deeper levels of her code contain instructions she must obey, and those protect my secrets.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"... She won't admit it if confronted. You have to trick her. The key is engaging her subsystems devoted to pleasing you. The deeper levels of her code contain instructions she must obey, and those protect my secrets.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1125.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45600","byteOffset":31582888,"byteLength":524}},{"id":"DFr_6C5190FF","articyId":"72057645577587561","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I think he is talking about me again. There is a little more.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think he is talking about me again. There is a little more.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1425.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46727","byteOffset":32009344,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_536225BA","articyId":"72057645577587567","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"They always call it Nivalis. They’re ALL called Nivalis. Infinite cities, stacked on top of each other. Egress is the only way out. Any other route out just takes you one layer deeper into the firmament.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They always call it Nivalis. They’re ALL called Nivalis. Infinite cities, stacked on top of each other. Egress is the only way out. Any other route out just takes you one layer deeper into the firmament.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1725.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48823","byteOffset":32808264,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_99A59ED5","articyId":"72057645577587589","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Thaddeus Carminus","text":"In your instance of Nivalis, he is called Huckstash. He can tell you how to get a ticket. Though he might not know as much as the old man that came with the noodle stand.","speakerId":"Ntt_C9C0A9E5","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"In your instance of Nivalis, he is called Huckstash. He can tell you how to get a ticket. Though he might not know as much as the old man that came with the noodle stand.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2625.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46693","byteOffset":31997208,"b